 **Pitfalls:**
-*   **Forward Scattering:** The model ignores forward scattering. This is a reasonable approximation only if the scene consists mostly of completely opaque surfaces. In participating media with significant forward scattering, this model will underestimate radiance [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Ambient Light:** The model explicitly ignores ambient illumination. It is only valid for idealized ToF cameras or scenes where active IR illumination dominates ambient light [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Forward Scattering:** The model ignores forward scattering, which is reasonable if the scene consists mostly of completely opaque surfaces [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Ambient Light:** The model explicitly ignores ambient illumination and assumes the camera and light are at the exact same position [S1, unofficial].
 
